Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}各位，我希望你们见见一个人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Guys? There's, uh, somebody I'd like you to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等等 那是什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wait, wait. What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这是马塞尔，要打声招呼吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That would be Marcel. You wanna say hi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不，我不要{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. No, I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他好珍贵喔 你从哪里找到他的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, he is precious. Where did you get him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我朋友贝瑟 把他从实验室救出来的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My friend Bethel rescued him from some lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好残忍喔{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That is so cruel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么会有父母亲 把孩子命名为贝瑟{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why? Why would a parent name their child Bethel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那猴子的屁股上 长了个罗斯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, that monkey's got a Ross on his ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}罗斯，他要跟你住在你的公寓吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ross, is he gonna live with you, like, in your apartment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对，卡萝离开后 家里冷冷清清的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah. I mean, it's been kind of quiet since Carol left, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么不找个室友就好了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why don't you just get a roommate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道，我觉得到了某种年纪…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ah, I don't know. You reach a certain age...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}跟室友住有点可悲{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...having a roommate is just kind of pathe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.57,0:00:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}抱歉，我的意思是说 是很酷的生活方式{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh, sorry, that's "pathet," which is Sanskrit for "really cool way to live."{\r}
