Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：大卫·修蒙）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（中央咖啡厅）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}各位，我今晚唱的 都是新写的歌{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You guys, I'm doing all-new material tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有十二首有关我母亲自杀的新歌{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I have 12 new songs about my mother's suicide...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}一首讲的是雪人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and one about a snowman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你最好用雪人那首开场{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Might want to open with the snowman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 嘿，乔伊 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}GROUP: Hey, Joey. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：亚当·却斯  艾拉·安德里德）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 嘿，乔 - 结果怎么样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}ROSS: Hey, Joe. - So how'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我没拿到工作{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ah, I didn't get the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}怎么可能？ 你是去年的圣诞老公公耶{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How could you not get it? You were Santa last year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道，某个胖子 跟店经理上床{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know. Some fat guy's sleeping with the store manager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（导演：彼得·邦纳兹）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.83,0:02:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他根本无法逗人开心 这就是政治{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}He's not even jolly. It's all political.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那你要当什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So, what are you gonna be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我会当他的助手之一{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm gonna be one of his helpers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这真是个耻辱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's just such a slap in the face, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们都知道新年 要做什么了吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do you guys know what you're doing for New Year's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}干嘛 新年有什么问题吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Gee, what? What is wrong with New Year's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你是没有，你有巴洛{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Nothing for you. You have Paolo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你不用面对那可怕的节庆压力…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You don't have to face the horrible pressures of this holiday...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}急须着寻找有嘴唇的生物…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...desperate scramble to find anything with lips...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在球落下的那一刻 有个可以亲嘴的对象，我真大声{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...just so can have somebody to kiss when the ball drops. Man, I'm talking loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}告诉你，巴洛新年时 人会在罗马{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, for your information, Paolo's gonna be in Rome this New Year's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我会跟你们一样可悲{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So I'll be just as pathetic as the rest of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你想得美{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我受够了这个节日的疲劳轰炸{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's just that I'm sick of being a victim of this Dick Clark holiday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我提议今年 不要找伴，大家作个约定{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I say this year, no dates, we make a pact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}就我们六个人 一起吃晚餐{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Just the six of us. Dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 好啊 - 好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Sure. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我希望大家的反应 能热烈一点{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, I was hoping for a little more enthusiasm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Woo! - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 菲比，轮到你了 - 好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Phoebe, you're on. - Oh. Oh, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}各位，因应观众热烈的要求…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, hi. Ladies and gentlemen, back by popular demand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}请大家欢迎菲比布非{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...Miss Phoebe Buffay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谢谢大家{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thanks. Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}一开始我想先唱首 在这个佳节对我意义重大的歌曲{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, ahem, I want to start with a song that means a lot to me this time of year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我做了一个人 眼睛是煤炭做的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I made a man with eyes of coal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他有谜样般的微笑{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And a smile so bewitchin'{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How was I supposed to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我母亲死在厨房的事实{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That my mom was dead in the kitchen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}啦…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}La-la-la{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我母亲的骨灰{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My mother's ashes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}甚至是她的睫毛{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Even her eyelashes{\r}
